  "understanding": "The supplied code establishes a partial implementation map for a Go Raft library. Leader dispatch, follower AppendEntries handling, replication responses, commitment aggregation, and asynchronous step-down form a concrete A1/A2 dependency chain. Storage success, peer response acceptance, commitment advancement, transition notification, and completed role change are distinct observations. Durability under failures, alternate replication paths, elections, startup, and application completion remain incompletely recovered. Documentation and interface comments describe intended semantics; no execution evidence or correctness conclusion is available.",
